WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.632
On Home, click Add portfolio
photos. This box opens.

2
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:06.175
Click Choose photos and
pick as many as you like.

3
00:00:06.175 --> 00:00:08.994
Or drag a batch from a folder onto this box.

4
00:00:08.994 --> 00:00:11.994
Drag any photo to change its
place. Lead with your favorites.

5
00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:16.836
Press Publish. They are on
the website in minutes.
